# SYNTHETIC (hand-made). In leader mode Mod is symbolic: it must not
# resolve through the previous mask (Mod4 by default), so explicit Mod4 bindings do
# not alias the leader and a real Super after the leader does not match Mod chords.
mod leader F12
defaults
bind Mod4+x once explicit-mod4
# leader then x: Mod4+x is not a leader chord, x is forwarded
k F00C
K
k 78
c 78
K
# leader then h: Mod+h
k F00C
K
k 68
c 68
K
# leader then a real Super+h: not Mod+h, forwarded
k F00C
K
k F868
k F868 68
c 68
K F868
K
